# Saved sessions. They contain live access tokens for the local stack, and a
# token in git is a token in git regardless of how worthless it is.
.auth/

# Traces, videos, failure screenshots and the HTML report. Regenerated by every
# run; kept next to the suite rather than at the repository root so that this one
# file covers every artefact the harness produces.
.artifacts/

# Visual baselines are NOT ignored. __screenshots__/ is committed on purpose:
# a baseline nobody can review is a baseline nobody can trust, and the diff in a
# pull request is where a colour or spacing regression is actually caught.
